msgctxt "quest/038/XxaUse114_03877:TEXT_XXAUSE114_03877_VORSAILE_000_060:1"
msgid "A pleasure to see you as always, <if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if>."
msgstr "Всегда рад вас видеть, <if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if><else><split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if>."

#. ja: いやあ、来てもらえて本当によかった。<br>実は、ことはなかなか深刻でねえ……。
#. de: Ich bin wirklich über alle Maßen erleichtert, dich hier zu sehen. Wenn wir doch nur von solchen Vorfällen verschont bleiben könnten! Nun, lass mich die Lage kurz erklären.
#. fr: Le hasard fait bien les choses car vous êtes justement la personne que je voulais voir. Je vais vous expliquer ce qui se passe.
#. speaker: VORSAILE
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)>Thank you for coming so swiftly.<else>Thank you for answering my summons. Quite frankly,</if><else>Thank you for answering my … — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 < 127)>Thank you for coming so swiftly.<else>Thank you for answering my summons. Quite frankly,</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) < 127 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/XxaUse114_03877:TEXT_XXAUSE114_03877_VORSAILE_000_061:1"
msgid "<if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)>Thank you for coming so swiftly.<else>Thank you for answering my summons. Quite frankly,</if><else>Thank you for answering my summons. Quite frankly,</if> I could think of no one more qualified to─ Ah, but we're getting ahead of ourselves. Allow me to explain..."
msgstr "<if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 < 127)>Благодарю, что так быстро приехали.<else>Благодарю, что откликнулись на мой зов. Признаться,</if><else>Благодарю, что откликнулись на мой зов. Признаться,</if> я не мог представить себе более подходящего человека... Ах, но я забегаю вперёд. Позвольте всё объяснить..."
